Mobile:

{% video src="/videos/experience/bowtie-jp-health/phone.mp4" poster="/videos/experience/bowtie-jp-health/phone-poster.webp" title="Booking a health check on a phone, from choosing a service through to a date and time" /%}

#### Trade-off

## We kept the login.

Every step removed makes booking easier, but the clinic still has to know each booking comes from a real person and not spam. So the final flow keeps the login, and puts the effort into making everything around it shorter.

#### Outcome

## A quarter less scrolling on a phone.

{% stats %}
